        "TileImage": "$($repository 2e1a30c5-b1e0-4984-b3f4-67f01f9ebfef).Image",
        "Description": "Good afternoon 47,\rYour targets are Akira Nakamura and Katashi Ito.They are know for their synonyms: The director and the kurator. You need to eliminate them before going on with our last target: Carlton Smith, a former ICA Agent who switched sides and now has dangerous Intel about the ICA in his hands. He got kidnapped by the Kurator, so we dont really have information about how to reach Smith, but you should find a way.\rI will leave you to prepare.",
